unifi-evo-usher
https://github.com/foonerd/unifi-evo-usher

evo-usher-steward is the evo steward with the usher's plugins compiled
in. The usher's face, its catalogue and its configuration stand beside
it.

The usher's own code, its catalogue and its face are under the MIT
licence, which follows.

The evo framework, which the program contains, is not. Its steward and
runtime are under the Business Source License 1.1, with the terms of use
its licensor grants: that licence is LICENSE-evo.txt, beside this file.
The framework's source, and the licences of the parts of it that are
under another, are at https://github.com/foonerd/evo-core.

The program also contains libraries of other authors, each under its own
licence. Cargo.lock in the usher's repository names every one, with its
version.

